## Quiet Descent — 25 minutes
##
## Acoustic parameters mirrored from a public curated session library;
## score re-authored in SBaGen .sbg format.
## Independent work - not affiliated with or endorsed by any third party.
## Source ease-out/ease-in transitions render
## natively (entrain extended syntax).
##
## Deep, immersive descent: pink bed swelling 50 -> 65, carrier
## 250 -> 180 Hz, beats 10.5 -> 4.5 Hz, tones kept very quiet.
##
## extended syntax: entrain

off: -
alpha-preparation: pink/50 250+10.5/10
alpha-state: pink/55 250+8.5/5
theta-state-one: pink/60 180+6.5/5
theta-state-two: pink/65 180+4.5/5

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 alpha-preparation
00:01:00 alpha-preparation
00:05:00 alpha-state ease-out
00:08:00 theta-state-one
00:13:00 theta-state-one
00:14:00 theta-state-two
00:19:00 theta-state-two ease-in
00:24:00 alpha-state
00:25:00 off
